                "word": "doofus",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e0cb1810-cdc7-468b-8a89-22798339a896",
                        "entry_id": "f4dc5e67-b39f-365f-9024-9cb9c6354152",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "doofuses"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d621dd19-237e-4f28-a693-c2594600c609",
                        "entry_id": "f4dc5e67-b39f-365f-9024-9cb9c6354152",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "doofi"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                        "entry_id": "f4dc5e67-b39f-365f-9024-9cb9c6354152",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with poor judgment and taste; a foolish or silly person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "humorous",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5118edcc-cece-4803-8d74-78acc82a0561",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "Stocks Genius or Dot-Com Doofus? – Wired News"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "249ce9eb-9a7d-4dce-b816-e672803a3d4e",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "Danny is such a doofus!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f442e683-8b43-4c84-9603-8ad50fdb4572",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "Nichols had called Bonilla a doofus who was too damn stupid to realize that he was being taken by a hooker with a convincing sob story.\nEven if Steve was a doofus, Nichols and Rand were quite willing to work for him as long as he had money."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1f506ac-4318-4f35-89f9-9614328ada86",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "They weren't excited about acquiring new information; they were relieved to find out they aren't the only doofuses (or maybe the word is \"doofi\") in the world of rusty machinery."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b234a1ff-d488-4393-86a8-17a5a378459d",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "2005 October 17, Kevin Amorin, Mewsday, quoted in 2007, Troth Wells, T-Shirt, page 14,\nBeing too young to attend a show on Bowie's 1983 Serious Moonlight tour, I did what any underage doofus would do. I bought a concert T-shirt – three-quarter-length blue sleeves, image of Major Tom himself on the front."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9776168f-870e-423b-87ca-8ce818437a14",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "\"I never seen so many doofuses in one place!\"\n\"That's doofi, Krakauer. Sorry to correct you.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fa7e2d2-49b8-4b57-b56c-d0dfb50753ea",
                                "sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                                "text": "\"No problem. You get a bimbo babe who's engaged to a doofus who will fall for the virgin birth line and still marry her.[…]However, I don't think a doofus fiancé will be hard to find; there's no shortage of doofuses on the earth.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c07a74ec-2175-4bb5-ae84-a6950a0cc248",
                        "source_entry_id": "f4dc5e67-b39f-365f-9024-9cb9c6354152",
                        "source_sense_id": "5bfcd84a-f8bc-323c-99f6-9e1079c4a221",
                        "source_sense_description": "person with poor judgement and taste",
                        "target_lang_word": "andouille",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "andouille",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f190003-fa5f-34ec-9442-05673cdd698c",
                                        "entry_id": "1e6be3a2-f5d4-32b0-8714-3f60d04ef46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Saucisse de boyau de porc rempli de tripes ou de chair hachée du même animal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Charcuterie",
                                            "France"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fb14688-2205-451b-9e60-22a755cf8da1",
                                                "sense_id": "7f190003-fa5f-34ec-9442-05673cdd698c",
                                                "text": "Andouilles fumées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f79a96cc-b72b-44d5-8ea6-0dada885bd64",
                                                "sense_id": "7f190003-fa5f-34ec-9442-05673cdd698c",
                                                "text": "Faire griller une andouille."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "937b4317-4181-4b58-9a63-f8d4f93b597a",
                                                "sense_id": "7f190003-fa5f-34ec-9442-05673cdd698c",
                                                "text": "Une bonne omelette que suivit une andouille grillée, arrosée de bon cidre piquant, rendit la gaieté à tout le monde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d6813ae-6530-45e9-b1f7-9cf395ae7390",
                                                "sense_id": "7f190003-fa5f-34ec-9442-05673cdd698c",
                                                "text": "Walter, voulez-vous servir les andouilles, s’il vous plaît ? Enfin, je veux dire servir les andouilles aux invités !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "365f0a2a-31a4-3f78-897b-1b87461f8a7e",
                                        "entry_id": "1e6be3a2-f5d4-32b0-8714-3f60d04ef46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est en forme d’andouille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ae2752e-191d-467b-aa6e-d133c5b59591",
                                                "sense_id": "365f0a2a-31a4-3f78-897b-1b87461f8a7e",
                                                "text": "On donnait jadis le nom d’andouilles de tabac aux feuilles de tabac roulées en fuseau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                        "entry_id": "1e6be3a2-f5d4-32b0-8714-3f60d04ef46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Imbécile, idiot. Cette injure a cependant un sens familier, voire affectueux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "offensive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a15cef9f-7a4b-4345-80a9-fddda72f7aee",
                                                "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                                "text": "Bonhomme, me prenez-vous pour une andouille ? Regardez-moi bien. Ai-je l’air d’un jocrisse ?…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86573644-7d8f-4eab-9cd6-25e035ef8e07",
                                                "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                                "text": "— Cette cochonnerie de travail c’est pas fait pour moi, non, très peu, c’est pas une vie. Faut être l’andouille, née de l’andouille pour s’accoutumer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5d59074-924c-414d-ba30-773d8c895cee",
                                                "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                                "text": "Tonton devant ce résultat\nNe se dégonfla pas\nEt joua les andouilles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2758700-d25b-4afd-99c9-a03440cdce17",
                                                "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                                "text": "C’est encore cette andouille de Gravelin, qui n’a aucun sens du discernement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c0c5736-f915-464e-9dfd-7aabfa244a30",
                                                "sense_id": "6778facb-2008-3b25-a985-484cd0a140da",
                                                "text": "Et en plus, à faire l’andouille, là, je suis en train de cochonner mon Cerruti."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68b2cb9e-a82d-3178-afe0-3ef548aab965",
                                        "entry_id": "1e6be3a2-f5d4-32b0-8714-3f60d04ef46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Défaut du papier venant de la pâte accumulée dans certaines parties de la feuille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Histoire des techniques",
                                            "Papeterie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1038b7f8-f9a8-317e-b095-c5c40a3a2151",
                                        "entry_id": "1e6be3a2-f5d4-32b0-8714-3f60d04ef46b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pavé de deuxième choix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c57b1b80-ccbf-4eb7-a64c-1902cc6aa6ec",
                                                "sense_id": "1038b7f8-f9a8-317e-b095-c5c40a3a2151",
                                                "text": "Rue pavée d’andouilles à Saint-Gengoux-le-National."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
